Describe this image for someone who cannot see it.

Cover, in order:
- what kind of image it is (screenshot, photo, diagram, chart, document)
- the subject, and anything notable about it
- all text visible in the image, transcribed verbatim
- for charts or tables: the axes, the series, and the values you can read
- for screenshots: the application, the visible UI state, and any error text

Be specific and factual. Do not speculate about intent, and do not add commentary.
If the image is unreadable, say so plainly in one sentence.
